WEBVTT

00:00:03.080 --> 00:00:08.700
We're fighting right now in the galaxy soccer tournament, Grand Celesta Galaxy.

00:00:08.970 --> 00:00:12.150
Our next opponent is the planet Sazanaarah.

00:00:12.570 --> 00:00:16.330
We continue to fight as we aim to be best in the universe.

00:00:19.200 --> 00:00:22.120
I just have to look at your Azul to know what you're thinking...

00:00:24.440 --> 00:00:25.920
My head...!

00:00:34.180 --> 00:00:35.590
Goal!

00:00:35.930 --> 00:00:37.100
He did it!

00:00:37.100 --> 00:00:39.220
That's Matatagi's Soul!

00:00:40.060 --> 00:00:42.190
It's unbelievable to think he had such power...

00:00:42.190 --> 00:00:43.850
It's my turn now.

00:00:46.550 --> 00:00:48.360
As if we'd ever rely on you.

00:01:01.010 --> 00:01:02.450
Anyone else with a problem?

00:02:42.830 --> 00:02:48.980
Yay! It's the second match in Grand Celesta Galaxy between Sazanaarah versus Earth Eleven!

00:02:49.300 --> 00:02:51.790
The first half has ended at a tie of 1-1!

00:02:51.790 --> 00:02:53.720
The second half will begin momentarily!

00:02:55.720 --> 00:02:57.490
Their helper's on the field, huh.

00:02:59.300 --> 00:03:02.050
The real fight begins now.

00:03:02.050 --> 00:03:05.490
I, Hilary Flail, will exterminate you.

00:03:07.250 --> 00:03:08.680
You guys!

00:03:09.010 --> 00:03:11.790
Watch my Azul closely and send me passes!

00:03:12.120 --> 00:03:13.710
She's such a jerk.

00:03:13.710 --> 00:03:15.570
Powai hates people like her.

00:03:16.030 --> 00:03:17.280
Lady Powai.

00:03:17.500 --> 00:03:19.010
All right.

00:03:19.790 --> 00:03:22.230
No holding back, everyone.

00:03:22.230 --> 00:03:25.080
Let's show them how strong we are!

00:03:25.080 --> 00:03:26.180
Yes, milady!

00:03:27.340 --> 00:03:29.680
They'll be seeing our thoughts in the second half as well.

00:03:30.030 --> 00:03:33.230
Even if they know what we're thinking, we won't lose!

00:03:33.740 --> 00:03:34.900
Don't be slow.

00:03:35.570 --> 00:03:38.480
I don't need anyone who can't keep up with me.

00:03:39.050 --> 00:03:43.500
It's great that Matatagi-kun is showing us his honest self now, but...

00:03:43.500 --> 00:03:45.370
He's way too into it...

00:03:47.610 --> 00:03:50.250
His Azul is the only one I can't read.

00:03:50.250 --> 00:03:54.140
If I force myself to look at it closer, it threatens to rip my Azul apart.

00:03:54.790 --> 00:03:57.720
But the Azul of the others...

00:03:58.850 --> 00:04:00.770
...are so very easy to read.

00:04:02.380 --> 00:04:04.890
The second half starts with Earth Eleven's kickoff!

00:04:05.450 --> 00:04:06.390
Captain!

00:04:07.410 --> 00:04:08.010
Sakura!

00:04:09.240 --> 00:04:12.430
Wow! Earth Eleven moves up their passes!

00:04:12.880 --> 00:04:13.430
I can get through!

00:04:16.820 --> 00:04:17.710
Sakura!

00:04:18.860 --> 00:04:20.570
They read her mind!

00:04:21.420 --> 00:04:22.240
Capis! {カピス}

00:04:24.080 --> 00:04:26.410
You know without me having to tell you, huh?

00:04:26.840 --> 00:04:29.870
Hey, yo! Hilary Flail moves up!

00:04:30.260 --> 00:04:33.080
She came from another planet to help them...

00:04:33.550 --> 00:04:35.220
That means she can't see my thoughts.

00:04:35.460 --> 00:04:37.420
If she can't tell what I'm thinking...

00:04:37.510 --> 00:04:38.880
I've got this one!

00:04:45.590 --> 00:04:46.760
Jack Knife!

00:04:47.080 --> 00:04:47.890
Kusaka!

00:04:50.930 --> 00:04:53.000
You'll get hurt if you touch me.

00:04:56.310 --> 00:04:57.600
It's wide open.

00:04:58.730 --> 00:05:00.770
Having others know what I'm thinking is highly convenient!

00:05:01.420 --> 00:05:01.940
Valha!

00:05:02.750 --> 00:05:04.200
Wow! Her pass goes through!

00:05:04.880 --> 00:05:07.160
Their offense advances with Hilary at its center!

00:05:08.530 --> 00:05:09.350
Powai!

00:05:09.800 --> 00:05:10.680
Over here!

00:05:10.680 --> 00:05:11.660
All right!

00:05:13.330 --> 00:05:14.600
So cool!

00:05:14.600 --> 00:05:16.600
Sazanaarah's fierce attack continues!

00:05:16.600 --> 00:05:18.570
Earth Eleven can't get the ball back!

00:05:18.570 --> 00:05:19.710
Cheer up!

00:05:20.240 --> 00:05:22.550
Their thoughts are being read completely.

00:05:23.420 --> 00:05:28.050
If they're able to see our thoughts, then perhaps if I act differently from what I'm thinking...

00:05:29.200 --> 00:05:30.510
From the front!

00:05:32.770 --> 00:05:33.970
Too bad!

00:05:33.970 --> 00:05:36.860
You wanted me to think you'd go straight, but you were really going right.

00:05:36.860 --> 00:05:37.980
I can see it, you know.

00:05:38.330 --> 00:05:40.150
Think you're hot stuff, do you?

00:05:40.460 --> 00:05:43.150
Don't forget that I'm here!

00:05:49.860 --> 00:05:52.870
Go ahead and read my thoughts if you can!

00:05:53.570 --> 00:05:54.570
Matatagi-kun!

00:05:54.570 --> 00:05:56.580
Nice cut, Matatagi!

00:05:58.530 --> 00:06:00.210
All right, we've gotta back him up!

00:06:03.480 --> 00:06:04.840
I'll bring it up to the goal!

00:06:05.040 --> 00:06:05.840
Stop right there!

00:06:08.710 --> 00:06:10.970
Waterfall!

00:06:15.770 --> 00:06:16.430
Miss Churuka!

00:06:16.430 --> 00:06:18.600
Sazanaarah counterattacks without a moment's delay!

00:06:19.020 --> 00:06:19.560
Oh no!

00:06:21.330 --> 00:06:22.400
I won't let you through!

00:06:24.370 --> 00:06:26.400
Defense Equation!

00:06:28.080 --> 00:06:29.240
She gets past Manabe!

00:06:31.020 --> 00:06:32.240
Tighten the defense!

00:06:33.930 --> 00:06:35.160
You're not going another step!

00:06:35.460 --> 00:06:38.460
They stop her with four people!

00:06:49.130 --> 00:06:51.430
Earth Eleven desperately defends the goal!

00:06:51.660 --> 00:06:53.970
Not even Sazanaarah is able to advance that easily!

00:06:57.260 --> 00:06:58.680
He gets past Kusaka!

00:07:03.560 --> 00:07:05.570
Bubble Boil!

00:07:07.570 --> 00:07:08.360
I'll stop it this time!

00:07:11.400 --> 00:07:14.440
Rising Slash!

00:07:19.110 --> 00:07:20.110
Okay!

00:07:20.730 --> 00:07:22.210
Ibuki blocks it!

00:07:22.950 --> 00:07:27.920
We managed to stop it this time, but we won't win if all we do is keep defending.

00:07:28.280 --> 00:07:30.170
Isn't there some way?

00:07:30.710 --> 00:07:32.930
If only we could see their thoughts too...

00:07:33.170 --> 00:07:34.910
Their thoughts...

00:07:35.220 --> 00:07:36.430
Their mindsets...

00:07:36.820 --> 00:07:38.770
<i>Don't leave it all to chance.</i>

00:07:39.460 --> 00:07:42.440
<i>You need to get into the same mindset as your opponent in order to predict how they will come at you.</i>

00:07:44.020 --> 00:07:47.620
Don't leave it all to chance, huh...

00:07:49.130 --> 00:07:50.350
Valha moves up!

00:07:52.950 --> 00:07:53.950
How will she approach?

00:07:54.170 --> 00:07:56.370
Right or left?

00:07:59.060 --> 00:07:59.870
She's scared?

00:08:00.220 --> 00:08:02.710
Leaf Roll!

00:08:08.800 --> 00:08:09.380
Minaho-kun!

00:08:10.880 --> 00:08:11.590
Over here!

00:08:12.240 --> 00:08:13.730
Matatagi is free!

00:08:13.730 --> 00:08:16.400
This is their big chance for a counterattack!

00:08:19.730 --> 00:08:21.400
GO!

00:08:25.080 --> 00:08:26.860
Unbelievable!

00:08:26.860 --> 00:08:30.740
Sazanaarah wins another point due to Minaho's own goal!

00:08:31.350 --> 00:08:32.740
M-Minaho...

00:08:35.800 --> 00:08:38.460
What is he thinking?

00:08:38.460 --> 00:08:40.660
Powai has no clue!

00:08:41.930 --> 00:08:45.620
I found a way for us to beat Sazanaarah...

00:08:47.130 --> 00:08:48.530
Everyone!

00:08:48.530 --> 00:08:49.840
Let's go score points!

00:08:50.570 --> 00:08:51.730
Minaho-kun...

00:08:53.330 --> 00:08:55.800
The match resumes with Earth Eleven's kickoff!

00:08:56.040 --> 00:08:57.050
That's mine!

00:08:56.750 --> 00:08:57.050
What?

00:08:57.050 --> 00:09:00.060
Hey! Minaho suddenly steals the ball!

00:09:00.460 --> 00:09:01.810
Come on, let's go!

00:09:03.200 --> 00:09:04.640
What are you doing?!

00:09:05.040 --> 00:09:06.600
What am I doing?

00:09:06.600 --> 00:09:09.150
I'm predicting how they'll move by getting into the same mindset as them.

00:09:10.910 --> 00:09:13.440
Predict how they move by getting into the same mindset...

00:09:13.950 --> 00:09:14.840
I see!

00:09:15.770 --> 00:09:17.510
Let Minaho do his thing!

00:09:17.510 --> 00:09:19.240
We'll keep fighting on our own!

00:09:21.730 --> 00:09:22.240
Okay!

00:09:24.250 --> 00:09:25.530
I'll stop you!

00:09:25.530 --> 00:09:26.910
You're not getting there!

00:09:28.730 --> 00:09:30.250
Minaho blocks his own teammate!

00:09:30.290 --> 00:09:37.130
Just when he blocks Tetsukado and heads for his own team's goal, now he cuts for a chance ball!

00:09:43.400 --> 00:09:45.220
What is he thinking?

00:09:45.220 --> 00:09:47.130
Powai's head is all a mess!

00:09:47.130 --> 00:09:48.440
I'll stop him!

00:09:51.420 --> 00:09:51.900
No way!

00:09:51.900 --> 00:09:52.900
It's mine!

00:09:53.820 --> 00:09:56.400
Matatagi plunges through an opening and keeps the ball!

00:10:09.880 --> 00:10:11.380
Aqua Breath!

00:10:16.040 --> 00:10:17.220
It's in!

00:10:17.220 --> 00:10:20.550
Earth Eleven brings the score to a tie!

00:10:21.440 --> 00:10:23.370
I-It went in?

00:10:23.370 --> 00:10:25.060
What just happened?

00:10:25.640 --> 00:10:27.620
As expected of Matatagi-kun.

00:10:27.620 --> 00:10:29.900
You knew what role you had to play.

00:10:30.860 --> 00:10:32.860
Knew his role?

00:10:32.860 --> 00:10:34.110
What do you mean?

00:10:34.550 --> 00:10:36.650
It's spontaneous plays.

00:10:36.650 --> 00:10:38.880
Spontaneous?

00:10:38.880 --> 00:10:43.370
We've been thinking about all sorts of ways on how to beat them and win,

00:10:43.370 --> 00:10:45.370
so maybe not thinking at all isn't so bad once in awhile.

00:10:46.440 --> 00:10:50.000
With spontaneous plays, they won't be able to predict what we'll do.

00:10:50.000 --> 00:10:52.150
So that's what you meant, Shindou-san!

00:10:52.150 --> 00:10:52.710
Yeah.

00:10:53.350 --> 00:10:57.460
Don't think too much about how you should beat them.

00:10:57.730 --> 00:10:59.950
Just play with the ball.

00:11:00.240 --> 00:11:01.280
Play?

00:11:01.280 --> 00:11:02.860
That sounds interesting.

00:11:03.260 --> 00:11:04.930
Let's try it!

00:11:05.950 --> 00:11:08.840
Inazuma Eleven GO Galaxy!

00:11:10.840 --> 00:11:13.950
Inazuma Eleven GO Galaxy!

00:11:15.910 --> 00:11:18.280
Hey hey, the score is 2-2!

00:11:18.280 --> 00:11:20.700
Who will score the next goal?

00:11:20.950 --> 00:11:23.480
They're acting so silly!

00:11:23.480 --> 00:11:25.730
Powai just won't forgive that!

00:11:25.730 --> 00:11:27.910
I'm the one who will have to score the goals after all.

00:11:30.440 --> 00:11:31.370
It's mine!

00:11:33.730 --> 00:11:34.500
Tetsukado!

00:11:35.550 --> 00:11:38.210
What?! He makes a back pass with the ball he stole!

00:11:38.620 --> 00:11:39.630
I'll play, too!

00:11:40.480 --> 00:11:41.310
Wah, it's here!

00:11:42.330 --> 00:11:43.430
Me?!

00:11:45.400 --> 00:11:46.350
A-Again?

00:11:47.570 --> 00:11:49.390
Okay then, I'm dribbling!

00:11:53.800 --> 00:11:55.730
This is ludicrous. I'll put an end to this!

00:11:58.260 --> 00:11:59.690
Which way is he going?

00:12:00.910 --> 00:12:03.700
Kusaka goes through! Or rather, he was gone through!

00:12:04.000 --> 00:12:05.240
He wasn't even trying to move up?

00:12:06.930 --> 00:12:10.200
Whoa, Earth Eleven's passes are heading up the field!

00:12:10.570 --> 00:12:12.000
That's it.

00:12:12.000 --> 00:12:13.210
They're doing great.

00:12:13.510 --> 00:12:15.280
What? What's going on?

00:12:15.280 --> 00:12:17.710
I can't read how they'll move from their Azul at all!

00:12:20.630 --> 00:12:21.820
Now!

00:12:23.620 --> 00:12:24.260
I see it!

00:12:25.660 --> 00:12:27.140
Aqua Breath!

00:12:32.130 --> 00:12:33.820
Sazanaarah stops them!

00:12:36.020 --> 00:12:36.650
So close!

00:12:37.240 --> 00:12:43.530
We're able to keep the ball now, but when we think about scoring the goal, they're able to tell.

00:12:44.170 --> 00:12:47.860
Then let's get points without trying to get points.

00:12:51.110 --> 00:12:51.910
Over here!

00:12:55.170 --> 00:12:57.830
Sazanaarah commences its counterattack!

00:12:58.710 --> 00:12:59.590
I'll score!

00:13:00.000 --> 00:13:01.090
I won't let you!

00:13:07.420 --> 00:13:08.680
Jack Knife!

00:13:09.110 --> 00:13:10.130
Kusaka!

00:13:10.130 --> 00:13:11.180
Leave this to me!

00:13:12.910 --> 00:13:13.930
Out of my way!

00:13:23.600 --> 00:13:24.650
A Soul?!

00:13:24.860 --> 00:13:26.070
Minaho has one, too!

00:13:28.260 --> 00:13:30.740
Everyone! Close your eyes for three seconds!

00:13:34.730 --> 00:13:36.250
Why are they closing their eyes?

00:13:36.860 --> 00:13:38.620
1... 2...

00:13:38.620 --> 00:13:39.630
Now!

00:13:41.500 --> 00:13:43.170
So that's it!

00:13:44.130 --> 00:13:50.300
The moment you open your eyes, you respond reflexively to the ball without giving them time to read your thoughts.

00:13:51.080 --> 00:13:53.180
You can get points without trying to get points!

00:13:54.040 --> 00:13:55.140
I call it...

00:13:55.420 --> 00:13:58.520
The "What I'm Not Ready Here Goes" Strategy! {ハッとしてグー作戦}

00:13:58.660 --> 00:14:00.650
1... 2...

00:14:00.650 --> 00:14:01.360
Now!

00:14:11.600 --> 00:14:12.870
Goal!

00:14:13.420 --> 00:14:14.540
You did it, Zanakurou!

00:14:15.400 --> 00:14:17.000
I thought you would say that!

00:14:19.860 --> 00:14:21.330
The match is over!

00:14:21.530 --> 00:14:26.050
Earth Eleven turns the score around to move on to the third match!

00:14:27.750 --> 00:14:29.760
Powai doesn't care anymore!

00:14:35.460 --> 00:14:37.860
It was a tough fight.

00:14:37.860 --> 00:14:38.730
Yes.

00:14:38.730 --> 00:14:40.620
Be grateful.

00:14:41.220 --> 00:14:44.730
We won thanks to my hard work.

00:14:48.680 --> 00:14:50.680
We managed to win.

00:14:51.370 --> 00:14:56.750
If we keep this up and reach Katora, we'll be able to save everyone.

00:14:57.550 --> 00:15:00.530
Including the people on this planet too...

00:15:05.730 --> 00:15:07.420
We can phone back to Earth?

00:15:08.150 --> 00:15:09.910
Oh, I thought I already told you.

00:15:10.240 --> 00:15:15.150
Only for ten minutes once a week, though, when the electromagnetic waves are in tune.

00:15:15.440 --> 00:15:17.510
The rest are already waiting their turn in line.

00:15:17.510 --> 00:15:19.060
You ought to go, too.

00:15:19.840 --> 00:15:21.660
Tenma, are you going to call Aki-san?

00:15:21.660 --> 00:15:23.440
Oh... no one.

00:15:25.150 --> 00:15:31.530
I've decided that until we win Grand Celesta Galaxy and return to Earth,

00:15:32.040 --> 00:15:33.910
I won't contact anyone.

00:15:34.640 --> 00:15:35.660
Tenma...

00:15:37.110 --> 00:15:38.730
Let's do our best to the very end.

00:15:39.080 --> 00:15:41.120
I'll be cheering you guys on with all I've got.

00:15:42.620 --> 00:15:43.570
Yeah.

00:15:49.930 --> 00:15:51.530
Hey, it's Nii-chan!

00:15:51.530 --> 00:15:53.220
Huh? Is there something different about you?

00:15:54.750 --> 00:15:55.430
Just a bit.

00:15:55.600 --> 00:15:58.130
Nii-chan, take a look at this!

00:15:58.130 --> 00:16:00.080
Jiro is such an idiot!

00:16:00.080 --> 00:16:03.440
I took his Super Space Robot Baronda plamo! {宇宙超人バロンダー}

00:16:04.110 --> 00:16:08.110
He doesn't have a clue! Isn't that funny, Nii-chan?

00:16:08.110 --> 00:16:09.800
That sure is funny!

00:16:10.460 --> 00:16:14.450
But Shun, you remember what I told you, right?

00:16:14.910 --> 00:16:15.770
Yeah!

00:16:15.770 --> 00:16:19.950
I did just as you said! No one saw me and no one knows I did it!

00:16:20.350 --> 00:16:22.710
I see. That's good.

00:16:22.710 --> 00:16:25.960
But I bet it was a real shock to Baronda.

00:16:27.460 --> 00:16:28.970
Well, think about it.

00:16:28.970 --> 00:16:33.460
The hero who defeats evil is now in the hands of a thief.

00:16:33.460 --> 00:16:35.640
B-But... I...

00:16:36.260 --> 00:16:40.140
Good for you, getting the Baronda you always wanted, huh?

00:16:41.950 --> 00:16:45.150
I-I don't want Baronda anymore...

00:16:45.510 --> 00:16:48.020
Then be sure to give it back...

00:16:48.020 --> 00:16:49.820
...to that idiot Jiro.

00:16:56.200 --> 00:16:58.660
Pixie! When did you get here?

00:17:00.730 --> 00:17:01.840
Katora!

00:17:01.840 --> 00:17:04.000
Please follow me.

00:17:05.750 --> 00:17:06.710
Okay.

00:17:20.130 --> 00:17:21.280
That's...

00:17:21.930 --> 00:17:24.180
The second shard of hope.

00:17:29.510 --> 00:17:31.040
The second one?

00:17:31.040 --> 00:17:31.950
Yeah.

00:17:32.280 --> 00:17:33.910
Katora <i>does</i>  exist.

00:17:34.240 --> 00:17:36.070
She's the one guiding us.

00:17:36.930 --> 00:17:38.070
That's impossible.

00:17:38.600 --> 00:17:40.570
But I heard her voice!

00:17:41.040 --> 00:17:43.040
Why do you keep insisting that Katora is dead?

00:17:44.510 --> 00:17:48.860
Because, I was the last person by her side.

00:17:49.530 --> 00:17:52.380
Right before Princess Katora met her death.

00:17:55.510 --> 00:17:59.860
I will tell you of what happened on that day.

00:18:00.200 --> 00:18:02.840
Of the frightening scene that I saw.

00:18:06.840 --> 00:18:10.660
Are you unable to explain things to us without turning into a clown first?!

00:18:10.880 --> 00:18:11.820
Look!

00:18:17.910 --> 00:18:18.780
That's...

00:18:19.110 --> 00:18:21.740
This is my real form.

00:18:22.440 --> 00:18:23.740
Real?

00:18:26.330 --> 00:18:33.800
I have already told you that my home planet, Kieru, was swallowed up by a variant black hole.

00:18:34.460 --> 00:18:41.760
At the time, I was a scientist in the midst of inventing the Cosmic Plasma Photon Beam that would save Kieru.

00:18:42.220 --> 00:18:45.770
Cosmic Plasma... P-Photon Beam?

00:18:46.460 --> 00:18:50.080
It is a weapon that can blot out a black hole.

00:18:50.080 --> 00:18:52.270
Blot out a black hole?

00:18:54.130 --> 00:19:00.550
Progress was going well, but I ran into an impasse at the last stage.

00:19:01.680 --> 00:19:04.130
While the structure of the photon beam was ready,

00:19:04.130 --> 00:19:11.790
I was unable to create mythril, a metal that can withstand containing the Cosmic Plasma's enormous energy.

00:19:12.750 --> 00:19:16.420
The leaders of Kieru's governing body deemed that we would be unable to make it in time,

00:19:16.420 --> 00:19:22.050
and they made the unanimous agreement that Princess Katora alone be saved so that she may rebuild our home one day.

00:19:23.110 --> 00:19:29.370
We made for her the last lifeboat that could shake off the black hole's pull.

00:19:30.040 --> 00:19:33.930
I cannot leave my people to save myself.

00:19:33.930 --> 00:19:36.710
I am the princess of this planet.

00:19:36.710 --> 00:19:40.020
I must be here with this planet when it meets its end.

00:19:40.910 --> 00:19:45.080
The one who must survive here is you, Potomuri.

00:19:45.680 --> 00:19:47.580
What are you saying, Your Highness?!

00:19:48.310 --> 00:19:54.020
You have the power to save many people's lives.

00:19:54.460 --> 00:19:58.260
When you come across another planet under the same circumstances as ours,

00:19:58.260 --> 00:20:02.720
you will be able to save the people of that planet.

00:20:03.420 --> 00:20:08.180
You are able to create hope using your intelligence and creativity of which there is no equal.

00:20:08.910 --> 00:20:11.840
You are the only one who can.

00:20:12.170 --> 00:20:14.190
But Princess Katora...!

00:20:15.600 --> 00:20:17.750
I'm counting on you.

00:20:19.080 --> 00:20:23.680
And with that, Princess Katora forced me to escape.

00:20:24.330 --> 00:20:29.080
She had decided that someone like me was worth more than her own life!

00:20:29.970 --> 00:20:37.750
But the force of the black hole was stronger than anticipated, and I managed to escape with only my soul intact...

00:20:39.020 --> 00:20:42.590
That is why it is impossible for Princess Katora to be alive.

00:20:44.040 --> 00:20:48.240
There was no other way for her to have escaped from there.

00:20:48.730 --> 00:20:51.350
She could only have been swallowed up by the black hole along with my home planet.

00:20:52.680 --> 00:20:54.680
As I would have...

00:21:01.570 --> 00:21:02.770
Potomuri...

00:21:03.530 --> 00:21:08.200
But it's Katora who's guiding us to save the galaxy!

00:21:08.680 --> 00:21:11.280
Then why is it you?

00:21:11.510 --> 00:21:14.910
Why does Princess Katora not show herself to me?

00:21:15.330 --> 00:21:17.420
I don't know, but...

00:21:18.350 --> 00:21:23.420
I cannot bring myself to believe that Princess Katora is still alive.

00:21:24.310 --> 00:21:25.420
Potomuri...

00:22:54.220 --> 00:22:56.330
We arrive at the next planet!

00:22:56.330 --> 00:23:00.080
What trap does the Shitennou have for us on this planet with unbearable heat?

00:23:00.080 --> 00:23:02.910
Next, The Volcanic Planet Gardon!

00:23:02.910 --> 00:23:04.570
This is super-dimensional soccer!

00:23:15.150 --> 00:23:19.440
The Inazuma Eleven GO Galaxy's proverb today is...

00:23:22.130 --> 00:23:26.200
Don't think too much about the details, just play with the ball!

00:23:26.570 --> 00:23:27.460
That's all!
